<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="recommended-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_frost_arcticwinds.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Frost Death Knights in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-frost-death-knight-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="$color" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Frost Death Knight gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute best-in-slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list from the ideal Frost Death Knight drops found in Phase 3 from raids, dungeons, reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high-ilvl gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/death-knight/frost/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Frost Death Knights</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best-in-Slot Gear for Frost Death Knight</h3>This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 3. While it does not feature the RNG-version of Thunderforged items, it does feature the Thunderforged items from the Heroic-only boss <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69473/ra-den">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ra-den</span></a>, as this boss will always drop Thunderforged-quality gear.<br/>
<br/>
