<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Frost Death Knights in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The Phase 3 set bonuses are great for Frost. The 2-set summons a Zandalari Troll to fight for you, that works very much like your <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=46584/raise-dead">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_animatedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raise Dead</span></a>, but instead of an ability it is a proc. The 4-set bonus is incredibly powerful, allowing you to cast <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=130736/soul-reaper">
