<del></del></span> Reaching Hit and Expertise Cap for Frost Death Knights</span></h2>In Mists of Pandaria your Hit cap is 7.5% Hit or 2550 Hit Rating and 7.5% Expertise or 2550 Expertise Rating. Keep in mind that some abilities, such as the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_draenei_female.gif");'></span> Draenei racial Heroic Presence, will contribute to your overall Hit and/<wbr/>or Expertise needed.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hit-rating">Hit Rating</h4>At 7.5% Hit, your special (yellow damage) hits will no longer be able to miss Raid bosses. This effectively means your abilities will never miss, though your regular swings still might. <br/>
<br/>Because they take their Hit rating from you, summoned minions from <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=46584/raise-dead">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_animatedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raise Dead</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=42650/army-of-the-dead">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_armyofthedead.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Army of the Dead</span></a> also require you to be Hit capped when attacking boss-level mobs, making reaching these caps even more important.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="expertise-rating">Expertise Rating</h4>At 7.5% Expertise, raid bosses will no longer be able to dodge your attacks. They will however still be able to parry them. For the vast majority of raid bosses, you will be positioned behind them, and enemies cannot parry attacks from behind.<br/>
<br/>Expertise also grants Spell Hit in Mists of Pandaria, making it much more important than earlier. Since a large part of your skill kit is spell based, not missing is essential.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="gemming">
