<del></del></span> Gemming for Frost Death Knights</span></h2>Death Knight has always been a class that feels better with gear. The more Stats you have, particularly Mastery, the more fun your character is to play. Gems are also a great place to grab any Hit and Expertise that we may be missing. This can be especially useful when aiming for Socket Bonuses, as <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76643/senseis-wild-jade">
