<del></del></span> Best Crafted Gear for Frost Death Knights</span></h3>Crafted items are an easy way to increase your item level and overall damage if you have an abundance of gold. Below are some suggestions for items that are great early options in their specific slots, should you have the gold to pay for them.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
